      "beat_id": "B00",
      "act": "ASK",
      "narration_text": "The CLAUDE.md file said NEVER, in capital letters: NEVER generate a final grade. Two sessions later, Claude wrote 'Overall performance: B plus' in the student summary. Not because Claude ignored the rule. Because CLAUDE.md is advisory — Claude reads it and tries. A PreToolUse hook script does not try. It either passes or blocks. That is the difference. This is Liam, in for Bear.",
