      "beat_id": "B01",
      "act": "NEVER-IGNORED",
      "narration_text": "Claude weighted the NEVER instruction against the prompt's pull — 'summarize student performance' — and the prompt won. This is probabilistic behavior: Claude is a language model, not a rule engine. CLAUDE.md rules are intentions that Claude tries to follow. They are not constraints that the system enforces.",
