    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "ASK-CLAUDE-PATTERN",
      "narration_text": "You do not need to write the hook script. Ask Claude to write it. Describe the pattern to block — any grade letter followed by a plus or minus, any sentence containing 'overall performance' followed by a grade. Claude drafts the script. You review it — ten to fifteen minutes. You test it. If it works, you commit it.",
