      "beat_id": "B04",
      "act": "VERDICT",
      "narration_text": "Two layers. CLAUDE.md sets intent — the teacher's values, the advisory rules, the workflow context. The hook enforces the inviolable constraints — the rules that must hold regardless of prompt context. One layer is probabilistic. The other is deterministic. Use both. Do not conflate them.",
